{\pard\ql\fs20 Bond fixed effects in all specifications.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 Driscoll-Kraay standard errors with maximum lag 4.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 All columns use the same 4,648-observation sample (103 bonds; 48 issuers).\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 Common-sample window: December 2010 to June 2025.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 Real Fed 3M uses SPF expected inflation.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 Real Brazil 3M uses Focus expected IPCA.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 RER is the bilateral USD/BRL CPI-based real exchange-rate index.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 Fiscal balance is the EHBBBR quarterly seasonally adjusted series.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 M4 adds total debt / total assets and maturity.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 M5 removes sovereign risk from M4.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 M6 additionally removes the Real Brazil 3M rate.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 M7 is the parsimonious VIX + Real Fed 3M + sovereign-risk specification.\par}
{\pard\ql\fs20 M8 adds OCF/assets to M4 as the accounting-liquidity comparison.\par}
